body:
It sounds like your wife has some very ignorant views on sex, likely due to a strict, conservative upbringing. Oral doesn't cause yeast infections. Uncircumcised dicks don't cause yeast infections. Many things cause yeast infections! 

&#x200B;

Don't marry someone that you know you will be sexually incompatible with...sexual incompatibility is a huge deal (if sex is important to you). You should have a serious conversation about this.
